 r←CompileController(schema toolsdir name);paths;pathsDecoded
⍝ Generate a controller class for handling REST requests via Jarvis
⍝ schema, object form of OpenAPI schema
⍝ toolsdir, name of namespace with shared tools
⍝ name, name of API
 r←⍬
 r,←⊂':Class ',name,'Rest'
 r,←⊂':Include ##.',toolsdir
 r,←⊂''
 r,←⊂'    (⎕IO ⎕ML)←1'
 r,←⊂''
 r,←⊂'    :Field Private Shared ∆schema←⎕JSON ',Quote ⎕JSON schema
 r,←⊂''
 r,←⊂':EndClass ⍝ ',name,'Rest'
⍝
